(text "Crystal circuit per design guide Sec 4: ABM8-272-T3, 15 pF each side (7.5 pF series + ~3 pF stray = 10.5 pF vs CL 10 pF),\n1 k in the XOUT leg to limit drive with a 50 ohm ESR crystal. C38 is the single design-guide decoupling exception (pins 68+69 share it).\nVREG_AVDD RC = 33 ohm + 4.7 uF (design guide Sec 2.1), taken from V3V3_SYS; VREG_FB is tied to DVDD, VREG_PGND to GND, EP to GND." (at 15 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6a4d1f66-f035-51bf-afe1-edccc536471c))
(text "PORT NAMING: a port label is named for the peripheral pin it comes from, so GPS_TX / ELRS_TX are module outputs\nand land on MCU UART RX pins, while GPS_RX / ELRS_RX are module inputs fed by the MCU UART TX pins. On J6/J7\n(POWER 3, Pixhawk DS-009 order 1 VCC / 2 TX / 3 RX / 4 GND) pin 2 is therefore GPS_RX / ELRS_RX.\nJ6 and J7 VCC are on V5_SYS; J9 VCC stays on V3V3_SYS. All port SIGNAL pins remain 3.3 V CMOS.\nGPIO39 (pin 48) is no longer spare: it reads PWR_SRC_ST, the open-drain ST output of U25 (TPS2121), which is\nhigh while 5V_IN (IN1) powers V5_SYS and low while USB VBUS (IN2) does." (at 155 233 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7ffa1526-44e4-5179-adb6-63756ab019c2))
(text "GPIO MAP (pin = QFN-80 pin)\nGPIO0    77  FLASH_CS1    QMI CS1n, log flash select\nGPIO1    78  IO_GPIO1     spare -> J16 pin 3\nGPIO2    79  PWM1         PWM1 A\nGPIO3    80  PWM2         PWM1 B\nGPIO4     1  PWM3         PWM2 A\nGPIO5     2  PWM4         PWM2 B\nGPIO6     3  MAG_SDA      I2C1 SDA\nGPIO7     4  MAG_SCL      I2C1 SCL\nGPIO8     6  ELRS_RX      UART1 TX -> radio RX\nGPIO9     7  ELRS_TX      UART1 RX <- radio TX\nGPIO10    8  PWM5         PWM5 A\nGPIO11    9  PWM6         PWM5 B\nGPIO12   11  GPS_RX       UART0 TX -> GPS RX\nGPIO13   12  GPS_TX       UART0 RX <- GPS TX\nGPIO14   13  PWM7         PWM7 A\nGPIO15   14  PWM8         PWM7 B\nGPIO16   16  SENS_MISO    SPI0 RX\nGPIO17   17  HG_ACC_CS    ADXL375 CS\nGPIO18   18  SENS_SCK     SPI0 SCK\nGPIO19   19  SENS_MOSI    SPI0 TX\nGPIO20   20  IMU_CS       ICM-45686 AP_CS\nGPIO21   21  IO_GPIO21    spare -> J16 pin 4\nGPIO22   22  BARO_CS      BMP581 CSB\nGPIO23   23  IMU_INT1     ICM-45686 INT1" (at 250 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7a781610-7140-5fb4-aac5-ea2b7f499f54))
(text "\nGPIO24   25  IMU_INT2     ICM-45686 INT2/FSYNC/CLKIN\nGPIO25   26  BARO_INT     BMP581 INT\nGPIO26   27  LED_DATA     WS2812C-2020 data, 100 R series (R55)\nGPIO27   28  IO_GPIO27    spare -> J16 pin 5\nGPIO28   36  BUZZ_PWM     buzzer gate drive\nGPIO29   37  HG_ACC_INT   ADXL375 INT1\nGPIO30   38  ESC_TELEM_RX ESC KISS telemetry in (PIO UART RX), 1k series R54\nGPIO31   39  IO_GPIO31    spare -> J16 pin 6\nGPIO32   40  SD_CLK       microSD CLK (PIO)\nGPIO33   42  SD_CMD       microSD CMD\nGPIO34   43  SD_D0        microSD DAT0\nGPIO35   44  SD_D1        microSD DAT1\nGPIO36   45  SD_D2        microSD DAT2\nGPIO37   46  SD_D3        microSD DAT3\nGPIO38   47  SD_DET       microSD card detect\nGPIO39   48  PWR_SRC_ST   U25 TPS2121 ST, open drain\nGPIO40   49  VBAT_SENSE   ADC0, VBAT 100k/10k divider, 36.3 V FS\nGPIO41   52  VBUS_SENSE   ADC1, USB_VBUS 10k/15k divider\nGPIO42   53  CURR_SENSE   ADC2, ESC current sense, 1k + 100n\nGPIO43   54  IO_GPIO43    ADC3 -> J16 pin 7\nGPIO44   55  IO_GPIO44    ADC4 -> J16 pin 8\nGPIO45   56  IO_GPIO45    ADC5 -> J16 pin 9\nGPIO46   57  IO_GPIO46    ADC6 -> J16 pin 10\nGPIO47   58  IO_GPIO47    ADC7 -> J16 pin 11" (at 338 14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2b4a3c56-3db3-5e59-a7e5-642560cb215d))
(wire (pts (xy 245.11 88.9) (xy 240.03 88.9)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 17456ae0-5d95-5ce9-881f-5b5785cc9982))
