(text "J16 SPARE IO (2.54 mm THT, right edge). 1 V3V3_SYS | 2 GND | 3 GPIO1 | 4 GPIO21 | 5 GPIO27 | 6 GPIO31 |\n7 GPIO43* | 8 GPIO44* | 9 GPIO45* | 10 GPIO46* | 11 GPIO47* | 12 GND.  * = ADC-capable (ADC3-ADC7);\nsilk-mark those five at layout. These GPIOs are no longer no-connect, so every RP2354B GPIO now\nterminates somewhere: 39 on board functions and ports, 9 on this block." (at 300 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid f7992eb2-274c-506a-a3ec-f1e3334aca30))
